WEBVTT

00:00:02.030 --> 00:00:04.450
The principles of a devil summoning.

00:00:05.030 --> 00:00:08.410
A devil summoned by sorcery

00:00:08.830 --> 00:00:11.460
must be sent back by sorcery.

00:00:12.250 --> 00:00:15.380
The human summoner becomes
the devil's master.

00:00:15.710 --> 00:00:18.510
As long as the summoner lives,

00:00:19.010 --> 00:00:21.720
the devil is bound
to the human world.

00:00:24.300 --> 00:00:26.600
-Got a package for ya!
-Thank you.

00:00:26.890 --> 00:00:29.390
-I-It was just a dream.
-Please sign here.

00:00:29.600 --> 00:00:33.980
-A dream? No, more like...
-Thanks, have a great day!

00:00:34.270 --> 00:00:36.310
-It's wrong to lie.
-You too.

00:00:37.730 --> 00:00:41.320
Won’t leave

00:00:41.530 --> 00:00:47.120
without a dropkick on her!

00:00:51.290 --> 00:00:53.170
Zazas Zazas Nasatanada Zazas

00:01:04.050 --> 00:01:08.180
-She summoned me, the evil god.
-Evil god!

00:01:08.390 --> 00:01:10.810
I gotta kill her or else
What?

00:01:11.020 --> 00:01:12.680
I can’t go back to Hell!
Sister...

00:01:12.890 --> 00:01:16.400
Yeah! Yeah! Yeah!
Life next to death, I combat with my chainsaw!

00:01:16.610 --> 00:01:18.320
If you go too far,

00:01:18.570 --> 00:01:22.320
I’ll slice you up completely!

00:01:22.610 --> 00:01:24.570
Your halo!
Must get it back!

00:01:24.780 --> 00:01:28.700
Never miss a chance
Hey, seriously?

00:01:28.910 --> 00:01:32.910
To attack her from behind!
You’re so mean.

00:01:33.120 --> 00:01:37.170
I’ll never give up.

00:01:37.380 --> 00:01:38.790
Yurine, you’re off your guard!

00:01:39.000 --> 00:01:42.960
Now!
Time to finish you with the Royal Copenhagen!

00:01:43.550 --> 00:01:45.880
Huh? What? I missed…

00:01:46.180 --> 00:01:49.300
Can’t leave Earth

00:01:49.510 --> 00:01:54.230
without a dropkick on her!

00:01:54.430 --> 00:01:57.600
But until then,

00:01:57.810 --> 00:02:03.530
let’s all have fun together!
Yeah!

00:02:08.030 --> 00:02:10.120
Tokyo, the big city.

00:02:11.160 --> 00:02:12.870
In the corner of this world,

00:02:13.870 --> 00:02:17.120
another day of bittersweet drama

00:02:17.460 --> 00:02:19.040
is about to unfold.

00:02:39.310 --> 00:02:42.020
Let the hot pot party begin!

00:02:43.980 --> 00:02:47.650
You're all in for a treat!
It's grade A beef!

00:02:48.280 --> 00:02:50.530
It's not like you bought it.

00:02:50.740 --> 00:02:53.120
D-Don't sweat the details.

00:02:53.370 --> 00:02:54.700
Let's get started!

00:02:55.580 --> 00:02:58.960
After heating up the pot,
we grease it with beef tallow.

00:03:00.580 --> 00:03:03.300
Then, we'll grill the green onions!

00:03:03.880 --> 00:03:05.460
Work up that appetite!

00:03:05.960 --> 00:03:07.340
Smells delicious!

00:03:07.550 --> 00:03:09.680
It smells wonderful!

00:03:10.220 --> 00:03:14.180
We'll take them out once they brown
so we can grill the meat.

00:03:15.890 --> 00:03:18.270
Please, God, forgive me.

00:03:18.640 --> 00:03:22.440
Forgive me for attending
a witch's Sabbath when I'm an angel.

00:03:23.020 --> 00:03:26.320
Yurine Hanazono, you kidnapped me
when I was starving.

00:03:26.530 --> 00:03:27.940
What are you scheming?

00:03:28.860 --> 00:03:30.530
No matter how hungry I am,

00:03:30.740 --> 00:03:33.280
I can't face God after this!

00:03:35.200 --> 00:03:37.290
Make sure both sides are cooked.

00:03:37.500 --> 00:03:39.960
Meat, meat, I love meat!

00:03:40.170 --> 00:03:42.580
Once it's fully cooked,
it's time for...

00:03:42.960 --> 00:03:45.800
Jashin-chan's special stock!

00:03:46.420 --> 00:03:48.050
We'll pour this right in!

00:03:52.430 --> 00:03:54.470
U-Unbelievable.

00:03:54.680 --> 00:03:57.720
Today's stock is especially divine!

00:03:57.930 --> 00:04:00.560
I must be a genius!

00:04:01.230 --> 00:04:02.770
Now we put in the veggies,

00:04:02.980 --> 00:04:05.110
cook them until brown,
and it's done!

00:04:05.320 --> 00:04:07.610
-I'm jealous, Yurine.
-Let me help you.

00:04:08.230 --> 00:04:11.400
You have generous relatives who send
you quality meat.

00:04:11.660 --> 00:04:14.370
It's not a regular thing.

00:04:14.620 --> 00:04:15.620
That's right!

00:04:15.830 --> 00:04:19.870
-We rarely have meat in hot pots.
-Huh?

00:04:20.540 --> 00:04:22.040
It's usually full of veggies.

00:04:22.790 --> 00:04:23.790
NO MEAT

00:04:24.000 --> 00:04:25.540
Guess I was lucky today.

00:04:26.000 --> 00:04:29.960
Why don't you get your relatives
to send us some meat in return?

00:04:31.760 --> 00:04:34.430
Because that'll make us cannibals.

00:04:35.720 --> 00:04:37.930
Ah, the hot pot's almost ready.

00:04:40.810 --> 00:04:41.850
Looks delicious.

00:04:42.060 --> 00:04:44.480
Here, Pekola, here's your egg.

00:04:45.770 --> 00:04:47.150
-Thanks.
-Now dig in!

00:04:47.360 --> 00:04:48.440
Let's eat!

00:04:48.650 --> 00:04:50.610
I've no choice.

00:04:50.990 --> 00:04:53.070
I'm starving.

00:04:53.410 --> 00:04:55.780
-God will forgive me.
-Delicious!

00:04:55.990 --> 00:04:58.410
It just melts in my mouth!

00:04:58.790 --> 00:05:00.250
It's all right.

00:05:01.290 --> 00:05:04.500
Pekola! What are you doing here?

00:05:05.210 --> 00:05:07.210
This is a devil's dinner.

00:05:07.420 --> 00:05:09.380
Coming from Heaven,

00:05:09.590 --> 00:05:12.720
you're forbidden to eat with us,
aren't you?

00:05:13.430 --> 00:05:15.390
Wait, Pekola's an angel?

00:05:15.720 --> 00:05:18.300
-Seriously?
-But you invited me.

00:05:19.140 --> 00:05:22.640
-Hey! Come by tonight for hot pot!
-Hot pot?

00:05:22.890 --> 00:05:23.890
Jashin-chan...

00:05:24.100 --> 00:05:25.560
You fool.

00:05:25.770 --> 00:05:27.770
W-Who are you calling a fool?

00:05:27.980 --> 00:05:31.940
She's the one who lost her halo
and can't go back to Heaven!

00:05:32.150 --> 00:05:33.320
T-That's...

00:05:33.530 --> 00:05:35.200
Enough already.

00:05:35.410 --> 00:05:37.620
Shut up! Not another word!

00:05:37.820 --> 00:05:39.830
-Jashin-chan...
-What?

00:05:40.120 --> 00:05:42.700
-Let's just enjoy our meal.
-But!

00:05:43.460 --> 00:05:46.040
Do not ruin this meal.

00:05:46.500 --> 00:05:48.290
-Got it?
-Yes, ma'am.

00:05:49.090 --> 00:05:52.670
Just kidding! Forget everything.
Let's enjoy our meal.

00:05:52.880 --> 00:05:54.550
W-What's wrong with you?

00:05:54.840 --> 00:05:57.760
Here! Let me make your plate
for you!

00:05:57.970 --> 00:06:00.050
-We're best friends!
-Jashin-chan...

00:06:00.260 --> 00:06:01.260
Such a handful.

00:06:01.470 --> 00:06:02.850
Here ya go, fallen angel.

00:06:03.060 --> 00:06:04.060
VEGGIES

00:06:04.270 --> 00:06:06.350
Not one slice of meat...

00:06:06.770 --> 00:06:09.940
Can't go wrong
with Wagyu beef, right?

00:06:10.400 --> 00:06:12.400
May I get some meat too?

00:06:12.610 --> 00:06:13.610
Rule number one.

00:06:13.820 --> 00:06:18.240
Finish everything in your bowl
before you go for seconds.

00:06:18.450 --> 00:06:19.870
My house, my rules.

00:06:20.160 --> 00:06:21.950
Oh, it's out of this world!

00:06:22.160 --> 00:06:24.160
So tender and juicy...

00:06:24.370 --> 00:06:28.500
And I'm an angel,
not a fallen angel...

00:06:29.580 --> 00:06:33.000
-Delicious!
-The veggies are good, but...

00:06:33.210 --> 00:06:36.590
-Scrumptious!
-They're good, but...

00:06:37.760 --> 00:06:39.220
The meat...

00:06:43.140 --> 00:06:44.520
Cow...horse...

00:06:52.360 --> 00:06:54.030
Finally...

00:06:54.360 --> 00:06:56.690
Bok choy sure does fill you up.

00:06:56.990 --> 00:06:58.990
-It's time--
-You finished, Pekola!

00:06:59.200 --> 00:07:00.660
Let me get that for you!

00:07:01.280 --> 00:07:02.870
Here ya go, fallen angel.

00:07:03.080 --> 00:07:04.700
Bon appétit.

00:07:05.200 --> 00:07:08.500
Jashin-chan, cut the bullying!

00:07:09.330 --> 00:07:11.710
You're such a child.

00:07:11.920 --> 00:07:13.380
See what I mean?

00:07:14.000 --> 00:07:16.130
Here, Pekola, say, "Ah."

00:07:24.640 --> 00:07:25.640
How is it?

00:07:25.970 --> 00:07:27.140
Delicious.

00:07:27.520 --> 00:07:29.020
I'm so glad.

00:07:29.560 --> 00:07:31.020
A-An angel.

00:07:31.440 --> 00:07:33.650
So who exactly is the angel here?

00:07:34.020 --> 00:07:36.400
Here, Pekola, have some more meat.

00:07:36.610 --> 00:07:38.860
Don't worry about the rules.

00:07:39.900 --> 00:07:40.910
There.

00:07:41.360 --> 00:07:44.120
Damn it!
You're all spoiling her rotten!

00:07:44.330 --> 00:07:48.540
Medusa, Minos, you're both devils!
Why are you taking the angel's side?

00:07:48.750 --> 00:07:50.120
Ignore her.

00:07:50.540 --> 00:07:52.830
Y-Yurine...

00:07:53.130 --> 00:07:55.960
If you're gonna play it like that...

00:07:57.090 --> 00:08:00.840
I'll just have to eat all the meat!

00:08:18.280 --> 00:08:19.570
-The meat...
-Hey...

00:08:19.820 --> 00:08:20.860
Don't do it...

00:08:23.530 --> 00:08:24.950
All done!

00:08:25.160 --> 00:08:26.410
J-J-Jashin-chan!

00:08:26.620 --> 00:08:30.370
-The meat...
-How could you?

00:08:31.330 --> 00:08:32.370
It used to be

00:08:32.960 --> 00:08:34.630
a hot pot full of meat.

00:08:35.960 --> 00:08:37.840
Our lovely meal...

00:08:38.460 --> 00:08:39.510
Jashin-chan...

00:08:40.090 --> 00:08:42.510
How will you pay for this?

00:08:43.590 --> 00:08:46.140
You won't get away with this.

00:08:48.260 --> 00:08:50.560
What? You wanna try me? Huh?

00:08:50.770 --> 00:08:53.020
I-I'll go buy more meat!

00:08:53.810 --> 00:08:57.020
There's not enough meat, you see?

00:08:57.230 --> 00:08:59.650
I'll end you first!

00:09:00.030 --> 00:09:03.660
I'm stuck here thanks to you.
All that resentment

00:09:04.070 --> 00:09:08.280
caused by you summoning me
is gonna end you right now!

00:09:08.580 --> 00:09:10.700
Jashin-chan Dropkick!

00:09:10.950 --> 00:09:13.580
The first episode
is also the season finale!

00:09:13.790 --> 00:09:16.290
Enjoy the rest as highlights!

00:09:21.380 --> 00:09:22.720
Damn you, reptile.

00:09:26.970 --> 00:09:28.930
Damn it! No! No! No!

00:09:29.720 --> 00:09:32.350
How about some freshly sliced snake?

00:09:32.600 --> 00:09:33.600
There's plenty.

00:09:33.810 --> 00:09:35.940
I'll go buy more meat.

00:09:36.150 --> 00:09:37.150
Too late now.

00:09:37.360 --> 00:09:39.900
-Wonder if it's any good?
-Yurine Hanazono.

00:09:40.270 --> 00:09:41.730
Never mess with her.

00:09:45.820 --> 00:09:48.240
Snake meat!
It's actually pretty good!

00:09:56.750 --> 00:09:58.460
-What's the password?
-Huh?

00:09:59.880 --> 00:10:02.170
-Um...
-Rhymes with Hannibal...

00:10:02.590 --> 00:10:03.880
Cannibal.

00:10:04.630 --> 00:10:05.970
You may enter!

00:10:06.220 --> 00:10:10.600
Don't scare me!
Jashin-chan, you're too paranoid.

00:10:10.810 --> 00:10:13.640
Never underestimate the human world.

00:10:16.440 --> 00:10:20.060
Jashin-chan,
I've been thinking these days...

00:10:20.980 --> 00:10:22.150
What about?

00:10:23.150 --> 00:10:25.320
-This....
-No way!

00:10:25.530 --> 00:10:27.320
You really got it for me!

00:10:28.530 --> 00:10:29.570
Huh?

00:10:31.080 --> 00:10:32.080
Jashin-chan.

00:10:32.290 --> 00:10:34.700
-You're up to no good, right?
-Yup.

00:10:35.790 --> 00:10:38.710
Idiot.
What the hell do you think this is?

00:10:38.920 --> 00:10:40.750
You can't have it!

00:10:40.960 --> 00:10:43.170
-I saw the news.
-The criminal escaped.

00:10:43.550 --> 00:10:46.300
According to police investigation,

00:10:46.670 --> 00:10:47.930
the weapon used...

00:10:48.510 --> 00:10:49.550
The weapon...

00:10:49.930 --> 00:10:51.430
Surprise, surprise!

00:10:51.760 --> 00:10:56.180
This weapon often gets
featured in crime reports.

00:10:58.390 --> 00:10:59.560
A crowbar!

00:11:00.520 --> 00:11:01.940
I figured it out.

00:11:02.270 --> 00:11:03.940
As I slept and ate all day,

00:11:04.320 --> 00:11:07.780
woke up and watched TV all day,

00:11:08.200 --> 00:11:10.030
I noticed how the crowbar

00:11:10.240 --> 00:11:12.830
would get featured on TV
almost daily!

00:11:13.200 --> 00:11:18.120
That's right! It's because
it's the best weapon to use to kill a human!

00:11:18.410 --> 00:11:20.540
Yurine's dead meat!

00:11:20.750 --> 00:11:22.040
Stop Jashin-chan!

00:11:22.250 --> 00:11:24.880
You'll end up killing Yurine!

00:11:25.550 --> 00:11:28.220
-Uh, that's the point.
-What?

00:11:29.010 --> 00:11:32.220
I'm gonna kill her with one strike!

00:11:32.850 --> 00:11:35.390
Ouch! Stop! Forgive me, please!

00:11:35.600 --> 00:11:37.730
No way! I'll never forgive you!

00:11:37.930 --> 00:11:39.020
ONE STRIKE...?

00:11:39.230 --> 00:11:43.110
Her brains will splatter
all over the place!

00:11:45.860 --> 00:11:47.440
This is too good.

00:11:47.650 --> 00:11:50.150
Plus, the crowbar was purchased
by Medusa.

00:11:50.530 --> 00:11:54.660
I'll be innocent,
and didn't pay a penny for it.

00:11:54.910 --> 00:11:57.620
It's the perfect crime!

00:11:58.290 --> 00:12:00.410
You're like the devil, Jashin-chan!

00:12:00.670 --> 00:12:03.000
Last I checked, I am the devil!

00:12:03.670 --> 00:12:06.380
Dear God, please give her
divine punishment.

00:12:06.630 --> 00:12:09.670
Nice try, but you're a devil too!

00:12:11.880 --> 00:12:12.890
I'm back.

00:12:13.090 --> 00:12:14.390
Welcome home!

00:12:14.680 --> 00:12:15.970
W-Welcome back.

00:12:16.600 --> 00:12:19.060
Oh, hey, Medusa. How are you?

00:12:19.270 --> 00:12:20.520
Doing well, thanks.

00:12:20.890 --> 00:12:22.730
That movie you wanted to watch?

00:12:23.020 --> 00:12:25.690
Medusa bought it for us!

00:12:26.270 --> 00:12:29.440
You must be tired.
Why don't you go wind down?

00:12:29.650 --> 00:12:32.030
Really? Thanks so much, Medusa.

00:12:32.410 --> 00:12:33.870
N-No problem.

00:12:34.280 --> 00:12:36.120
-Here you go.
-Thanks.

00:12:40.790 --> 00:12:42.040
Could I go watch it?

00:12:42.750 --> 00:12:44.920
Of course! Please do.

00:12:45.130 --> 00:12:46.380
Don't mind us.

00:12:54.340 --> 00:12:55.760
Holy shit!

00:13:01.390 --> 00:13:03.390
Get into it, Yurine.

00:13:03.690 --> 00:13:06.730
Because when you're completely
focused on the movie,

00:13:06.940 --> 00:13:09.030
I'm gonna bust your brains out!

00:13:09.570 --> 00:13:12.280
This is the end.

00:13:14.240 --> 00:13:17.950
Good bye, Yurine.
Viewers, it's your lucky day.

00:13:18.160 --> 00:13:22.710
You all get to witness human brains

00:13:23.080 --> 00:13:25.370
splatter all over the place!

00:13:25.580 --> 00:13:27.250
-Gotcha.
-What?

00:13:28.710 --> 00:13:29.710
Bam.

00:13:31.050 --> 00:13:33.720
-How did she know?
-You said it all out loud.

00:13:34.010 --> 00:13:35.180
Long lines, too.

00:13:35.970 --> 00:13:38.890
Sound engineer!
It's called internal monologue!

00:13:39.100 --> 00:13:41.060
Let's redo this! Cut! Cut!

00:13:41.270 --> 00:13:42.930
Who are you talking to?

00:13:43.180 --> 00:13:44.270
It was all Medusa!

00:13:44.690 --> 00:13:47.610
I resisted
but she threatened me to do it!

00:13:48.150 --> 00:13:50.150
Liar! You're unbelievable.

00:13:50.360 --> 00:13:52.360
Medusa, you're the liar here!

00:13:52.570 --> 00:13:55.280
-You're setting me up!
-I can't watch this.

00:13:57.490 --> 00:13:58.530
Jashin-chan.

00:14:00.910 --> 00:14:02.290
Need I say more?

00:14:02.790 --> 00:14:04.960
D-Damn it.

00:14:05.830 --> 00:14:09.250
Now I gotta resort to this.
The ultimate soul-crusher!

00:14:09.840 --> 00:14:12.510
Jashin-chan Dropkick!

00:14:23.270 --> 00:14:24.810
J-J-J-Jashin-chan?

00:14:30.900 --> 00:14:32.530
I can't get up.

00:14:32.980 --> 00:14:35.820
My spine's totally crushed.

00:14:40.620 --> 00:14:42.790
What the hell is that?

00:14:43.450 --> 00:14:45.290
You failed miserably.

00:14:46.000 --> 00:14:50.040
So I'm gonna take this opportunity
to treat our viewers

00:14:50.420 --> 00:14:55.300
to the slaughter of a devil,
where your insides get exposed

00:14:55.550 --> 00:14:58.180
-as you get minced.
-No! Yurine, stop!

00:14:58.380 --> 00:15:01.390
No! No!

00:15:01.890 --> 00:15:05.100
No!

00:15:07.230 --> 00:15:10.310
-You're just gonna turn a blind eye?
-Yup.

00:15:12.520 --> 00:15:16.440
That day, this room was scarlet red.

00:15:16.940 --> 00:15:19.070
Was it red from

00:15:19.700 --> 00:15:21.820
the sun setting in the skyline?

00:15:22.410 --> 00:15:24.410
Or the minced meat of Jashin-chan?

00:15:24.790 --> 00:15:26.830
I don't know!

00:15:27.040 --> 00:15:30.880
Jeez, I know I can regenerate myself
but don't just stand there.

00:15:32.590 --> 00:15:33.590
Now.

00:15:33.790 --> 00:15:37.880
Will Jashin-chan fully recover
during the commercial break?

00:15:38.090 --> 00:15:40.380
I have no idea!

00:15:41.510 --> 00:15:44.010
The murder weapon used
was the chainsaw itself.

00:15:49.980 --> 00:15:52.400
You're still censored.

00:15:52.810 --> 00:15:55.690
Don't worry, it'll come off soon.

00:15:58.690 --> 00:16:00.950
The room's gonna be spotless too.

00:16:01.280 --> 00:16:02.620
You can count on me!

00:16:02.990 --> 00:16:03.990
Okay.

00:16:04.830 --> 00:16:08.660
I'm gonna splurge tonight for dinner
so come back soon!

00:16:09.080 --> 00:16:10.620
See ya later!

00:16:11.000 --> 00:16:12.120
Bye.

00:16:18.210 --> 00:16:20.050
The censoring was all fake.

00:16:20.550 --> 00:16:21.550
Slurp.

00:16:22.590 --> 00:16:25.680
Yurine has no idea
that I'm fully recovered.

00:16:25.890 --> 00:16:27.060
TOMATO JUICE

00:16:27.520 --> 00:16:29.140
Today's her birthday.

00:16:29.560 --> 00:16:32.560
I'm gonna invite everyone
for a wild celebration.

00:16:32.980 --> 00:16:35.270
For a surprise party to celebrate
Yurine's death!

00:16:36.900 --> 00:16:39.360
Plus, my horoscope says
I've got the best luck today!

00:16:39.570 --> 00:16:40.570
SCORPIO

00:16:40.780 --> 00:16:44.280
I got Medusa to pick up the cake
and my lucky item for the day.

00:16:44.490 --> 00:16:45.490
LUCKY ITEM: STUN GUN

00:16:45.700 --> 00:16:47.280
I'm gonna be geared up!

00:16:47.580 --> 00:16:51.120
Ah, yeah!
It's gonna be a piece of cake!

00:16:51.540 --> 00:16:52.540
Break.

00:16:55.250 --> 00:16:57.130
As you requested.

00:16:57.340 --> 00:16:59.800
Thanks a lot!

00:17:00.210 --> 00:17:02.930
You're always so generous
with your money.

00:17:03.340 --> 00:17:06.930
Don't do it, Jashin-chan.
Don't commit any more crimes!

00:17:07.390 --> 00:17:10.680
Jashin-chan,
planning on killing Yurine again?

00:17:10.890 --> 00:17:13.390
You're gonna end up
paying for it anyway.

00:17:14.560 --> 00:17:18.270
Don't be ridiculous.
I'm all geared up today.

00:17:18.650 --> 00:17:20.070
-See?
-Huh?

00:17:20.320 --> 00:17:21.570
And for the record,

00:17:21.780 --> 00:17:25.820
I haven't committed
any kind of crime so far.

00:17:26.320 --> 00:17:28.530
Since it's been
a consistent failure.

00:17:29.160 --> 00:17:32.660
Anyway, let me give you the rundown
of how this is gonna go down.

00:17:33.790 --> 00:17:37.540
-I'm back.
-First, clueless Yurine comes home.

00:17:38.210 --> 00:17:41.210
-Happy Birthday!
-We distract her with a surprise.

00:17:41.510 --> 00:17:44.550
Forgive me, God,
I know I'm an angel, and yet--

00:17:44.760 --> 00:17:47.010
Hey! I'm not done here!

00:17:48.430 --> 00:17:49.640
We'll distract her.

00:17:49.970 --> 00:17:52.430
Then, I come running up
with a present--

00:17:52.640 --> 00:17:56.520
Not! It's the stun gun
Medusa picked up for me. Ta-da!

00:17:56.850 --> 00:17:58.360
I electrocute her.

00:17:58.730 --> 00:18:00.480
And she's paralyzed.

00:18:01.070 --> 00:18:03.650
Then, I'll finish her
using the kitchen knife...

00:18:03.860 --> 00:18:05.610
By stabbing her in the gut!

00:18:06.410 --> 00:18:07.530
The perfect plan.

00:18:07.910 --> 00:18:10.410
-What a joke.
-You'll fail again.

00:18:10.620 --> 00:18:13.160
No, I won't! My horoscope said so!

00:18:13.370 --> 00:18:16.040
-I'm geared up with my lucky item!
-I see.

00:18:18.250 --> 00:18:19.920
Yurine... But why...?

00:18:20.340 --> 00:18:22.800
You told me to come back soon.

00:18:23.340 --> 00:18:24.380
Whoopsie.

00:18:24.630 --> 00:18:26.590
Not much of a surprise now, huh?

00:18:26.800 --> 00:18:30.100
I'm so sorry.
I haven't even started cooking yet.

00:18:30.300 --> 00:18:33.600
-Medusa threatened me to do this!
-What?

00:18:33.810 --> 00:18:34.930
Such a manipulator.

00:18:35.140 --> 00:18:37.140
Just give up and apologize.

00:18:37.350 --> 00:18:39.440
It's a bit too late for that.

00:18:40.150 --> 00:18:41.520
Take this, Yurine!

00:18:41.730 --> 00:18:44.820
This is your birthday present
from me!

00:18:45.110 --> 00:18:46.400
Die!

00:18:49.280 --> 00:18:50.780
What?

00:18:54.410 --> 00:18:58.040
What the hell?
An electric shaver for beards?

00:18:58.290 --> 00:19:00.040
What are you trying to tell me?

00:19:00.420 --> 00:19:02.840
Medusa! You traitor!

00:19:03.050 --> 00:19:04.710
I just wanted you to stop...

00:19:04.920 --> 00:19:06.590
Cut the crap!

00:19:06.880 --> 00:19:09.970
You better do the same, or else...

00:19:11.390 --> 00:19:13.810
U-Um... Is that...a stun gun?

00:19:14.470 --> 00:19:16.140
You're a bit slow to notice.

00:19:16.350 --> 00:19:18.520
But my birthday's October 31st.

00:19:19.020 --> 00:19:20.850
I'm a Scorpio, just like you.

00:19:22.440 --> 00:19:24.190
SCORPIO
OCTOBER 23RD-NOVEMBER 21ST

00:19:24.480 --> 00:19:26.940
All right!
Time to finish decorating!

00:19:27.280 --> 00:19:29.410
-Yup.
-I'll prepare dinner.

00:19:29.910 --> 00:19:32.070
Jashin-chan... Come on.

00:19:32.780 --> 00:19:34.450
Need I say more?

00:19:36.000 --> 00:19:37.000
No.

00:19:40.000 --> 00:19:41.000
Yurine!

00:19:41.210 --> 00:19:43.380
Happy Birthday!

00:19:43.710 --> 00:19:45.000
Thank you all.

00:19:45.210 --> 00:19:47.090
Here's your egg, Yurine.

00:19:47.630 --> 00:19:50.720
-Thanks.
-Let me serve the meat for you.

00:19:58.930 --> 00:20:01.350
Delicious. I love the seasoning.

00:20:02.060 --> 00:20:05.940
Actually, that's all Jashin-chan.

00:20:06.980 --> 00:20:08.070
Really?

00:20:15.410 --> 00:20:18.160
Hey, is she gonna be okay?

00:20:19.160 --> 00:20:23.080
Oh, she'll be fine.
She can regenerate.

00:20:23.420 --> 00:20:27.420
-But...
-Don't worry, she'll regenerate.

00:20:29.920 --> 00:20:32.340
Hey, Medusa. Help me.

00:20:32.760 --> 00:20:33.800
No way!

00:20:34.350 --> 00:20:36.890
-Help me.
-No way!

00:20:38.560 --> 00:20:40.980
-Minos...
-Never!

00:20:41.190 --> 00:20:42.190
Jashin-chan.

00:20:44.270 --> 00:20:45.520
Do you repent?

00:20:47.820 --> 00:20:50.110
-Are you sure?
-Yes!

00:20:52.070 --> 00:20:53.110
Positive?

00:20:53.780 --> 00:20:54.780
Yes!

00:20:56.620 --> 00:20:58.120
Fine, then.

00:21:00.200 --> 00:21:01.540
I'll forgive you.

00:21:07.750 --> 00:21:09.210
Dig in, Jashin-chan.

00:21:11.130 --> 00:21:12.680
I still can't move.

00:21:13.760 --> 00:21:15.090
I'll feed you.

00:21:15.970 --> 00:21:19.600
Medusa prepared
such a great meal for us.

00:21:20.180 --> 00:21:21.480
Eat the beef tallow.

00:21:25.900 --> 00:21:29.690
So this is what they call,
"the Sabbath."

00:21:34.450 --> 00:21:36.240
Are we all ready?

00:21:44.120 --> 00:21:46.380
Come on. Give us a smile.

00:21:48.670 --> 00:21:50.670
I've had enough today.

00:21:52.550 --> 00:21:55.510
I had a pretty good time.

00:21:55.930 --> 00:21:57.760
You better say that.

00:21:58.140 --> 00:21:59.850
I've sacrificed myself--

00:22:00.060 --> 00:22:01.640
Now, smile at the camera.

00:22:01.890 --> 00:22:04.270
-Ready?
-If Yurine's a Scorpio like me...

00:22:04.480 --> 00:22:05.850
Happy Birthday!

00:22:06.730 --> 00:22:10.270
What about my birthday party?

00:22:31.040 --> 00:22:34.840
Dropkick on her! Yeah her!
I’ll take you down again!

00:22:35.130 --> 00:22:39.600
Hate you!
Love doesn’t exist in this world

00:22:40.390 --> 00:22:43.930
Fear the dropkick!
An Angel looks for her halo

00:22:44.220 --> 00:22:48.690
As she starves to death!

00:22:48.940 --> 00:22:51.770
It’s a love and hate relationship,

00:22:51.980 --> 00:22:54.190
can’t leave each other alone

00:22:54.440 --> 00:22:58.860
Like a galaxy-bursting shooting star!

00:22:59.110 --> 00:23:03.080
Slowly, slowly, sneak up and DIE!

00:23:03.290 --> 00:23:05.450
Test my heart, don’t stop

00:23:05.660 --> 00:23:12.540
Let’s go! Dream on! No matter human, angel or devil

00:23:12.750 --> 00:23:16.800
We’re a happy family La la la

00:23:17.170 --> 00:23:21.050
Let me say, I love you!!

00:23:21.260 --> 00:23:23.510
When all is said and done

00:23:23.720 --> 00:23:28.230
I’m home! Welcome back, it’s hot pot tonight!

00:23:28.440 --> 00:23:32.860
Come, gather everyone! Let’s enjoy this meal!

00:23:33.070 --> 00:23:35.070
For another crazy tomorrow

00:23:35.320 --> 00:23:38.820
What next? What next? In the end, Wakeup!

00:23:41.570 --> 00:23:43.620
When the summer heat is making you melt,

00:23:43.830 --> 00:23:45.450
you hear a knock at the door.

00:23:45.950 --> 00:23:50.210
There is a brutal snow woman who came from hell
that makes even our blood cold.

00:23:50.750 --> 00:23:55.000
Dropkick on My Devil!
Be prepared to be clotheslined by the next episode too!
